	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>Salus in Christo, et gaudium spiritus sancti!</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Omni<lb xml:id="p1z2"/>no eiusmodi res nostrae sunt, praestantissime vir, ut quid tibi <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>literis meis significem, plane non habeam, nisi fortasse vis <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>illud scire, quid in synodo de rebus ecclesiasticis decernatur, <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>et quo in statu res nostri principis sint positae.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Verum <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>cum haec omnia e literis <persName>Iohannae</persName>, ducis filiae, et <persName ref="p8107">Treherno</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>te cogniturum certo sciam, his de rebus plura scribere inprae<lb xml:id="p1z8"/>sentiarum supersedendum duco.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Tuas potius iam literas <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>in dies singulos avide expecto, et tales quales maxime opto.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z10"/><persName ref="p591">Chekum</persName> hominem doctissimum et fidelissimum amicum, <placeName ref="l1909">Warwicensem</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>vero ipsum facillimum fortissimumque principem cognosces.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z12"/>Per me si reddantur, ausim tibi obligare fidem meam ex<lb xml:id="p1z13"/>templo responsum tibi iri ab omnibus.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Simul ac igitur eas accepero, <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>quid a me sit actum scies.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">In rebus meis nihil <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>est novi, nisi quod magistrorum dignitatem iussu <persName ref="p672">Coxi</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>consensuque <persName ref="p8111">Martyris</persName> assumpsi.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Simul etiam ineptias istas <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>et desideria patriae deponam, et quo consilio istinc discesserim, <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>id assiduitate ac studio singulari consequi studebo.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell"><lb xml:id="p1z19"/>Vale diu multumque, doctissime vir mihique charissime <persName ref="p495">Bullingere</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z20"/><placeName ref="l376">Oxonii</placeName>, datae raptim calend. martii, <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>1552.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
